          "email": "patrick-bot@mulberrytree.us",
          "date": "2026-10-29 21:39:07.000000000",
          "tz": -300
        },
        "subject": "LU-20869 tests: speed up sanity test_56wa",
        "message": "LU-20869 tests: speed up sanity test_56wa\n\ntest_56wa creates 200 hard links to dir1/file1 and then pipes\nlfs find into lfs migrate, which migrates the same file once per\nlink. The 200 links date from LU-6051, when the old lfs_migrate\nscript deduplicated hard links, and no longer check anything\nspecific.\n\nCreate 2 links instead, which still exercises migrating a\nhard-linked file. On a VM the test takes 5 to 11s instead of 31\nto 38s (one outlier of 33s in six runs). At 17047 CI runs per 30\ndays that saves about 25s per run, over 100 hours; CI runs take\nfar longer than the VM (mean 194s), so the saving there should\nbe larger.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity env=ONLY=56wa\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I589d0d9f52161d9c0532a3601e56fdf75238d999\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
